tk-intel-display is a bounded Rust translation of MIT-licensed Linux 7.2.3
i915 display components. The original grants are preserved in LICENSE-MIT.
No GPL i915 ACPI/trace code is included. No firmware or private capture data
is bundled; external capture tests read user-supplied files without modifying them.

