  ADL-P has five exposed universal planes, no DG2 4-tile interpretation.
  No auxiliary plane/DPT ownership, joiner or allocation is implied by readout.

src/color.rs:
  drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/intel_color.c (display13 branches):
  skl_get_config, hsw_read_gamma_mode, ilk_read_csc_mode, icl_read_csc,
  ilk_read_pipe_csc, icl_read_output_csc, icl_read_luts,
  icl_has_{pre,post}_csc_lut, glk_read_degamma_lut, ilk_read_lut_8,
  bdw_read_lut_10, ivb_lut_10_size, icl_read_lut_multi_segment,
  intel_color_lut_pack, i9xx_lut_8_pack, ilk_lut_{10,12p4}_pack,
  glk_degamma_lut_pack
  Copyright © 2016 Intel Corporation.
  intel_color_regs.h selected fields: Copyright © 2023 Intel Corporation.
  Indexed reads preserve/verify firmware selectors under a backend lock.
  Multi-segment readout retains upstream's nine-super-fine-entry limitation,
  explicitly incomplete, never a fabricated full 1024-entry LUT.

The current excerpt scanner inventory for this crate is five outside-fence
code-line matches at25, two at40, no fenced/comment/range-marked matches.
In addition to ARRAY_SIZE, upstream_color.rs contributes the conventional
min expression, LEGACY_LUT_LENGTH constant and two MIT color-state member
layouts at25; only the dual drm_property_blob pointer declaration also meets40.
These are C compile-shim facts/declarations, not imported driver bodies or prose.
No scanner exemption is applied. Whole crates/ax totals are registered in CI.

src/scaler.rs:
  drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/skl_scaler.c:
  skl_pipe_scaler_get_hw_state, skl_scaler_get_config (display13, CASF absent)
  Copyright © 2020 Intel Corporation.
  intel_display_regs.h: selected scaler fields
  Copyright © 2025 Intel Corporation.
  Additional original ownership readout checks BOTH scaler controls, including
  plane/reserved bindings skipped by the upstream pipe-only getter. Power must
  be pinned for PANEL_FITTER independently of the pipe. No filter programming.

src/watermark.rs:
  drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/skl_watermark.c:
  skl_wm_level_from_reg_val, skl_pipe_wm_get_hw_state, skl_ddb_entry_init,
  skl_ddb_entry_init_from_hw, skl_ddb_get_hw_plane_state,
  skl_pipe_ddb_get_hw_state, intel_enabled_dbuf_slices_mask (display13)
  Copyright © 2022 Intel Corporation.
  skl_universal_plane_regs.h / intel_cursor_regs.h: Copyright © 2024 Intel Corporation.
  skl_watermark_regs.h: Copyright © 2023 Intel Corporation.
  Six latency levels and dedicated SAGV/transitions, five planes plus cursor.
  DDB coordinates are still MBUS-relative; raw DBUF/MBUS state is retained.
  No WM allocation/computation, SAGV/PCODE or hardware writes are imported.

src/tc.rs:
  drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/intel_tc.c:
  adlp_tc_phy_is_ready, adlp_tc_phy_is_owned, tc_phy_owned_by_display,
  tc_phy_load_fia_params and legacy get_pin_assignment/get_lane_mask fields
  Copyright © 2019 Intel Corporation.
  intel_display_regs.h / intel_{mg,dkl}_phy_regs.h selected fields:
  Copyright © 2025 / 2022 Intel Corporation.
  Original additional DKL before-image readout uses the upstream HDMI setup
  register layout. It is not an upstream get_config or ownership-acquire port.
  Power/cold must already be pinned; no cold unblock or ownership write.
